<p>    Pound sterling	70.15		 70.25</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 28.35		 28.40</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.379		 0.381</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.41		 11.43</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.67		 11.69</p>
